==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From ''[[tuttugu]]'' meaning "[[twenty]]" + ''[[og]]'' "[[and]]" + ''[[níu]]'' "[[nine]]". Meaning '''twenty and nine'''.

===Cardinal numeral===
{{head|is|numeral}} {{indecl}}

# '''[[twenty-nine]]'''; the cardinal number after [[tuttugu og átta#Icelandic|tuttugu og átta]] and before [[þrjátíu#Icelandic|þrjátíu]].

